  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8b4b5953-dbfb-411e-984e-a28a2906b45a"],
 ", and their integrals over the momenta measured from the normal vacuum,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ee2dd688-2912-473e-9903-460d35f09b42"],

