Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["II.3 The recursion of the potential and the ground states", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"eec9f99f-332d-4af3-b916-04e1f1330abb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The task asks to change the potential until all three methods admit a \
superfluid. ",
 StyleBox["The effective couplings.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " For a uniform state whose normal self-energy is a Dirac mass and whose \
pair self-energy lies in the channel ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["K",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a7da88e6-225a-459d-9bf5-b9759b044b46"],
 ", every method acts through two numbers: the scalar coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "972edd78-efb2-44ba-91fc-721d8d5d23ff"],
 " (the shift of the Dirac mass per unit scalar density) and the pair \
coupling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a7575df4-c950-4c84-9132-9cda6448fd13"],
 " (the pair self-energy per unit pair amplitude), computed by ",
 StyleBox["effCouplings",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " from the self-energy maps of the terms. The normal vacuum is unstable \
towards pairing when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["P",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], ",", 
      StyleBox["P",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "/", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["crit",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "27588f74-4b2e-4a87-a80d-971708132146"],
 ", with the critical pair coupling of AS3,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86360414-4580-468a-be6c-82e2b3c7e1d0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["crit",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["LL",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}]}]], ",", "      ", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["I", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    StyleBox["M", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Integral]", "0", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["dq", "TI"]}], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]]], "\[LongEqual]", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "-", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["M", "TI"], "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
     StyleBox["arsinh",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     FractionBox["1", 
      StyleBox["M", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "."}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->1.25 
  Inherited,ExpressionUUID->"f7666369-47f3-4423-803c-76a9a4886c5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The three potentials.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76bafd71-e969-464a-8a72-3ac97434975b"],
 " (the author's: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3c2fe0ab-aa25-4ff0-82d7-5bf12ae21c47"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["V",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7009d542-f1dc-4c67-a181-2a878bffd4ea"],
 ", no pairing term) admits no superfluid in any method. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9f054079-cdc8-4cbb-afc1-0f154caf64d2"],
 " adds the pairing term with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "22.5"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e257e45-7b5d-4be0-b29f-8f13746733d7"],
 ", the value of AS3: HS becomes superfluid, but in KS and CJT the exchange \
contraction of the pairing term acts in the scalar channel as an attraction, \
the scalar channel becomes unstable, and the ground state is a massive state. \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "34462037-7147-4394-b96f-5dec6ec0b067"],
 " keeps the form and the vector coupling and fixes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["S",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "71382bba-dd41-41f3-adc1-d2737210996c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2a0cd771-642e-407f-99d1-4d400c155f8d"],
 " by two conditions on the CJT couplings: the scalar coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c5b190bb-202f-4042-b647-c4559e99a29a"],
 " (stable) and the pair coupling of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3ab1f406-60fe-4d19-a5d1-13431acdc0ff"],
 " (supercritical). The couplings are linear in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     SubsuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], 
      StyleBox["S",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4597ef1e-1197-491a-9bb7-41affaea4c06"],
 ", so the conditions are two linear equations, which the next cell solves \
from the computed couplings; the solution is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["S",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2.8"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
