  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "27d5eb56-6394-448a-905e-d753a9399b49"],
 " and the field at the edge of the critical region), ",
 StyleBox["rustGinzburgRegions",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " (the two regularizations of Section III.G.5) and ",
 StyleBox["rustHiggs",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " (the numbers of Section III.G.8, with a last row of the Standard Model)."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c53a6efb-bf14-4b78-a279-23f435c56ec1"],

