from the static pair response (-1.051e-3) equals the Taylor coefficient a^Tay \
of the nonlinear free energy of Section III.T (-1.051e-3) (relative \
difference)\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   [the same check: Rust \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"P3-G1 CJT\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\", Python \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"YP3-G1 CJT\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"]\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "PASS ", "WP3-G1 CJT", "  deviation ", "4.421e-10", " (tolerance ", 
   "1.000e-7", "): ", 
   "CJT: at 0.9 T_c the coefficient a(0) of |Phi|^2 from the static pair \
response (-1.051e-3) equals the Taylor coefficient a^Tay of the nonlinear \
free energy of Section III.T (-1.051e-3) (relative difference)", 
   "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-G1 CJT", ", Python ", "YP3-G1 CJT", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0042861380718184`*^9},
 CellLabel->
