  "PASS ", "WP3-G2 CJT", "  deviation ", "5.240e-12", " (tolerance ", 
   "1.000e-9", "): ", 
   "CJT: a(0, T) = (1 - lambda^P(T))/(lambda^P(T) g^P) at T/T_c = 0.9, 0.998, \
1.002, with lambda^P(T) of Section III.T.4 (largest relative difference)", 
   "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-G2 CJT", ", Python ", "YP3-G2 CJT", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004286142495667*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[383]:=",ExpressionUUID->"49f7c8d7-c79e-47f4-b9ce-0af96a0a4818"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"PASS \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"WP3-G10 CJT\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"  deviation \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"6.950e-12\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\" (tolerance \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"1.000e-8\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"): \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"CJT: alpha = T_c da/dT = 0.01117552279 from \
central differences of the static pair response (Richardson) = 0.01117552279 \
in closed form (lambda^P(T_c) = 1., M_n = 0.1622929325) = Rust (largest \
relative difference)\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   [the same check: Rust \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"P3-G10 CJT\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\", Python \"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"YP3-G10 CJT\"\>", 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"]\"\>"}],
