  "PASS ", "WP3-G10 CJT", "  deviation ", "6.950e-12", " (tolerance ", 
   "1.000e-8", "): ", 
   "CJT: alpha = T_c da/dT = 0.01117552279 from central differences of the \
static pair response (Richardson) = 0.01117552279 in closed form \
(lambda^P(T_c) = 1., M_n = 0.1622929325) = Rust (largest relative \
difference)", "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-G10 CJT", ", Python ", 
   "YP3-G10 CJT", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004286145542243*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[383]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d0d01f40-6c42-4dfd-b9cd-5dd9e4b549ef"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"PASS \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"WP3-G3 CJT\"\>", 
